@SpacesService_HostAddress = https://localhost:7187

### List all spaces
GET {{SpacesService_HostAddress}}/api/spaces
Accept: application/json

###

### Get space by id
GET {{SpacesService_HostAddress}}/api/spaces/{{spaceId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Search spaces
GET {{SpacesService_HostAddress}}/api/spaces/search/coworking
Accept: application/json

###

### Check availability
GET {{SpacesService_HostAddress}}/api/spaces/{{spaceId}}/availability?from=2026-07-10T09:00:00Z&to=2026-07-10T12:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

###

### Create space
POST {{SpacesService_HostAddress}}/api/spaces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sala Premium",
  "location": "Andar 2",
  "description": "Sala com projetor e ar-condicionado",
  "capacity": 10,
  "pricePerHour": 75.50
}

###

### Update space
PUT {{SpacesService_HostAddress}}/api/spaces/{{spaceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sala Premium Atualizada",
  "location": "Andar 2",
  "description": "Sala renovada",
  "capacity": 12,
  "pricePerHour": 85.00
}

###

### Delete space (soft delete)
DELETE {{SpacesService_HostAddress}}/api/spaces/{{spaceId}}

###
